 ('ChatGPT','chatgpt.com','Drafting and editing','Use the free tier for briefs and first drafts. Features and usage limits vary by account.','Optional subscription; check the live plan rather than assuming a fixed number of outputs.','https://chatgpt.com/pricing/'),
 ('Claude','claude.ai','Briefs, scripts, and copy','Free plan available. Pro: $20/month, or $200 billed annually ($17/month equivalent), checked 6 October 2026.','Usage limits apply. A subscription is not a fixed number of client deliverables.','https://claude.com/pricing'),
